                "name": "Piesikot",
                "url": "https://github.com/Piesikot"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41377217?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Clarifies when the HTMLMediaElement abort event can fire</li>\n<li>Updates the example so it starts one media load and then starts another before the first finishes</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issue</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #44222.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4503414392\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44222\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44222/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44222\">#44222</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Testing</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>markdownlint-cli2 files/en-us/web/api/htmlmediaelement/abort_event/index.md</li>\n<li>prettier -c files/en-us/web/api/htmlmediaelement/abort_event/index.md</li>\n<li>cspell --config .vscode/cspell.json files/en-us/web/api/htmlmediaelement/abort_event/index.md</li>\n<li>MDN pre-commit hook</li>\n</ul>",
