        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF152 adds support for the <code class=\"notranslate\">options.pseudoElement</code> param to be passed to <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/getAnimations#options\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Element.getAnimations()</code></a> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1935557\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1935557</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds the release note</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4469273324\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44160\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44160/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44160\">#44160</a></p>",
