        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38193798?u=51a29a96b848dcb858148a9940509bf1d87c682a&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">untangle the computed value for <code class=\"notranslate\">border-*-width</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">column-rule-width</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">outline-width</code> from their related <code class=\"notranslate\">*-style</code> properties.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2784905702\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11494\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11494/hovercard?comment_id=2675800489&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11494#issuecomment-2675800489\">w3c/csswg-drafts#11494 (comment)</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Relates <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4480621675\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44193\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44193/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44193\">#44193</a><br>\nRelates <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4413852604\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/data/issues/1069\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/data/pull/1069/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/data/pull/1069\">mdn/data#1069</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44195",
            "title": "untangle `border/column-rule/outline-width` from `*-style` properties value",
            "date_modified": "2026-05-19T22:10:50.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-05-19T22:09:18.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "sb3nder",
                "url": "https://github.com/sb3nder"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38193798?u=51a29a96b848dcb858148a9940509bf1d87c682a&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add high level description of  the <code class=\"notranslate\">Snap a length as a line width</code> rounding method, to the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Values/length\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;length&gt;</code> CSS type\"</a> page.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">The computed value for <code class=\"notranslate\">border-*-width</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">column-rule-width</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">outline-width</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">outline-offset</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">-webkit-border-*-width</code>, is specified as <strong>\"the absolute length, snapped as a line width\"</strong> .<br>\nThere is no docs explaing what that means, that I can easely link in the computed value description.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">border-*-width</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">column-rule-width</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">outline-width</code> snapped as a line width:<br>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"638316615\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5210\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5210/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5210\">w3c/csswg-drafts#5210</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Computed value untangled from <code class=\"notranslate\">*-style</code> properties value:<br>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2784905702\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11494\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11494/hovercard?comment_id=2675800489&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11494#issuecomment-2675800489\">w3c/csswg-drafts#11494 (comment)</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">outline-offset</code> snapped as a line width:<br>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3491018856\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12906\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12906/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12906\">w3c/csswg-drafts#12906</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Definition of \"length snapped as a line width\":<br>\n<a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-4/#snap-as-a-line-width\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-4/#snap-as-a-line-width</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #44193.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4480621675\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44193\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44193/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44193\">#44193</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Relates <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4413852604\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/data/issues/1069\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/data/pull/1069/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/data/pull/1069\">mdn/data#1069</a></p>\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44194",
