        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Adds <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;a href&gt;</code> to MathML</li>\n<li>Deprecates global <code class=\"notranslate\">href</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To update MathML <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;a&gt;</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">href</code> reference according to spec and implementation.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/mathml-core/#the-a-element\" rel=\"nofollow\">MathML Core adding the <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;a&gt;</code> element and deprecating global <code class=\"notranslate\">href</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2026848\" rel=\"nofollow\">Firefox 151 deprecating the global <code class=\"notranslate\">href</code> attribute</a> (behind the flag)</li>\n<li>Firefox 152 seems to be shipping it enabled by default (AFAIK)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4470936613\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44178\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/44178/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44178\">#44178</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4477590221\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29706\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29706/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29706\">mdn/browser-compat-data#29706</a></li>\n</ul>",
